WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.949
OT environments combine specialized control devices with familiar computing and networking technology.

00:00:04.949 --> 00:00:09.798
Understanding the role of each component helps analysts interpret traffic, ownership, exposure,

00:00:09.798 --> 00:00:11.011
and operational consequence.

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:16.264
A programmable logic controller, or PLC, executes control logic close to the process.

00:00:16.264 --> 00:00:21.517
It reads inputs, applies programmed rules, and updates outputs on a predictable cycle.

00:00:21.517 --> 00:00:26.366
A remote terminal unit, or RTU, performs similar monitoring and control functions,

00:00:26.366 --> 00:00:30.003
often at geographically distributed locations such as pipelines, substations,

00:00:30.003 --> 00:00:31.215
or pumping stations.

00:00:31.215 --> 00:00:35.660
These devices may operate for long periods with limited local support.

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:39.701
A human-machine interface, or HMI, gives operators visibility and control.

00:00:39.701 --> 00:00:43.338
It displays measurements, equipment state, alarms, and process graphics,

00:00:43.338 --> 00:00:47.783
and may allow authorized users to issue commands or adjust setpoints.

00:00:47.783 --> 00:00:51.824
A supervisory control and data acquisition system, commonly called SCADA,

00:00:51.824 --> 00:00:55.461
coordinates monitoring and supervisory control across a wider operation,

00:00:55.461 --> 00:00:58.694
often connecting central control functions with remote sites.

00:00:58.694 --> 00:01:02.331
Engineering workstations are used to configure controllers, develop logic,

00:01:02.331 --> 00:01:04.755
maintain device settings, and troubleshoot systems.

00:01:04.755 --> 00:01:08.392
Their privileges and software make them highly sensitive assets.

00:01:08.392 --> 00:01:12.029
Historians collect time-series process data for analysis, reporting, optimization,

00:01:12.029 --> 00:01:12.837
and investigation.

00:01:12.837 --> 00:01:16.070
Because historians frequently exchange data with business systems,

00:01:16.070 --> 00:01:19.303
they can sit near an important trust boundary.

00:01:19.303 --> 00:01:23.748
Sensors measure conditions such as temperature, pressure, flow, position, or speed.

00:01:23.748 --> 00:01:28.597
Actuators turn control decisions into physical action by moving valves, starting motors,

00:01:28.597 --> 00:01:31.022
operating breakers, or changing equipment position.

00:01:31.022 --> 00:01:35.467
Industrial networks carry data among these components using Ethernet, serial links,

00:01:35.467 --> 00:01:37.487
wireless systems, and specialized protocols.

00:01:37.487 --> 00:01:40.316
No component should be evaluated in isolation.

00:01:40.316 --> 00:01:44.357
A workstation may appear to be an ordinary Windows computer,

00:01:44.357 --> 00:01:47.589
but its engineering tools can alter a process.

00:01:47.589 --> 00:01:50.822
A network switch may carry time-sensitive control traffic.

00:01:50.822 --> 00:01:55.267
Good security begins by documenting each asset's function, communication relationships, owner,

00:01:55.267 --> 00:01:58.500
and consequence if it becomes unavailable or untrustworthy.
